{"path":"/documentation/intervention/backends/display","section":"documentation","title":"display","description":"Documentation for the nnsight Python library","toc":[{"id":"nnsight.intervention.backends.display","label":"display","depth":2},{"id":"nnsight.intervention.backends.display.StatusDisplay","label":"StatusDisplay","depth":3}],"segments":[{"type":"html","html":"<h2 id=\"nnsight.intervention.backends.display\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-module\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-module-name\">display</span>\n\n\n</h2>"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>In-place status line for a remote NDIF job, in a terminal or a notebook.</p>\n<p>A remote job moves through a lifecycle (RECEIVED -&gt; QUEUED -&gt; ... -&gt; RUNNING -&gt;\nCOMPLETED/ERROR); <a title=\"            StatusDisplay\" href=\"#nnsight.intervention.backends.display.StatusDisplay\"><code>StatusDisplay</code></a> renders that progress as a single\ncolor-coded line that updates in place -- a spinner while a stage is active, the\nfinal icon when it ends. The same line is built with ANSI escapes for a TTY and\nre-emitted as HTML for a notebook cell, so one renderer serves both.</p>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.intervention.backends.display.StatusDisplay\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-class\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-class-name\">StatusDisplay</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"StatusDisplay(enabled: bool = True, verbose: bool = False)"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>In-place, color-coded status line for a remote job (terminal or notebook).</p>\n<p>Active states animate a spinner (advanced by <a title=\"            refresh\" href=\"#nnsight.intervention.backends.display.StatusDisplay.refresh\"><code>refresh</code></a> between\nmessages); terminal states end the line. LOG messages print on their own\nline and don't replace the current lifecycle status.</p>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.backends.display.StatusDisplay.enabled\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">enabled</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"enabled = enabled"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.backends.display.StatusDisplay.verbose\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">verbose</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"verbose = verbose"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.backends.display.StatusDisplay.color\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">color</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"color = _supports_color()"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.backends.display.StatusDisplay.notebook\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">notebook</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-lab